    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74e5ceb77bb60e75d5f4d541",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "神业高声地呐喊道。\n自第二天起，训练中她那烦闷的叹息，\n已在不知不觉间消失无踪。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b262728a03de19521f7d2b1945a3c53445c18055bd87e444cb745d244e90af9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
