      "uid": "zhcn:10e1304d15445bbf9e0b6067",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――首先要拿下1次重赏赛的胜利。\n她的背景，由此开始搭建。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e241ffc57f1f6141836342058f8dbb000cb0239f456f7df678f8ff94d73889f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        143,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/143/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19d48d12efb85ca2523bee82",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "作为支持方・训练员，受她依靠是理所当然的。\n帮助她消除不安也是分内之事。\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "10e26a357772a0f15966d34ed9f10170aa29fa168902239ad16bf76f7556850f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137304.json",
      "json_path": [
