    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bd83ac94858e4153e926f1a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "还有就是小北她\n已经取得了成果所以有自信之类的！？\n那个……嗯嗯……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c46df2f3acfbb360ff4b4331d19d04ca71d5520591f55a7221274d08d27d6dea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137304.json",
      "json_path": [
