    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60a2901aae44a71b6484867c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『经验值带来的自我肯定感不足』\n……这确实是我页能想到的、\n让她感到烦躁的原因之一。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0df67f8962ef255e3cee6b4ad8f1f516788ca5adb79e880d0875531160230e61",
